        2317,
        1432
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Deputy Mayor Timothy W. Costello issued an Order to \"Administrators, Commissioners & Heads of Agencies\" concerning the Hatch Act (Public Law 89-554 of 1966) which prohibits certain political activity and named twenty agencies which are the recipients of Federal loans or grants. The order dated August 4, 1970 said:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.4161,
          "min": -2.0003
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 76,
