        "area_px": 798621,
        "density": 0.0,
        "chars": 315,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 105000.0
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        764,
        1461,
        2161,
        2035
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\"A state or local officer or employee so prohibited may not use his official authority or influence for the purpose of interfering with or affecting the result of an election or nomination for office, may not directly or indirectly coerce, attempt to coerce, command or advise a state or local officer or employee to pay, lend or contribute anything of value to a party, committee, organization, agency or person for political purposes, and may not take an active part in political management or in political campaigns.\" (Administrative Order No. 24).",
